<title>USA: Atrion sets three-for-two stock split.</title>
<headline>Atrion sets three-for-two stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Ala. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atrion Corp said on Thursday its board of directors approved a three-for-two stock split, in the form of a stock dividend, of one share for every two common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Cash would be paid in lieu of fractional shares, the company said.</p>
<p>The split would increase the number of outstanding common shares to about 3.2 million, Atrion said. The stock dividend would be payable on December 2 to shareholders of record on November 20, Atrion said.</p>
</text>
